1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 37=

4
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:44,860
What brings you here?

5
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:58,780
Chunhua.

6
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:01,980
I'll protect you.

7
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:04,300
This time,

8
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:07,940
if we can get through this,

9
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:13,140
no one will ever trample on us again.

10
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:15,100
Wenji.

11
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:17,100
What's happened?

12
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:27,380
Wenji.

13
00:03:27,980 --> 00:03:28,900
I'm a little scared.

14
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:33,700
Is it about the Princess?

15
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:35,220
What's happened to her?

16
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,180
It has nothing to do with her.

17
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:45,460
With the famine,

18
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,460
some refugees have stirred up trouble.

19
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:51,300
Really?

20
00:03:52,780 --> 00:03:54,140
Then why did you look so frightened?

21
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:00,620
Did I

22
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:04,340
look frightened just now?

23
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:20,220
You imagined it.

24
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:22,740
I'm just exhausted.

25
00:04:25,340 --> 00:04:26,940
I've spent all day on the coronation.

26
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:32,300
What coronation?

27
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:33,700
Tomorrow,

28
00:04:34,980 --> 00:04:36,620
Prince of Jin will
become the new emperor.

29
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:40,820
Him? The Emperor?

30
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:46,140
That doesn't matter.

31
00:04:47,740 --> 00:04:48,620
What matters is

32
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:56,020
what you'll become,

33
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:59,660
and what I'll become.

34
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:03,100
Tomorrow,

35
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,300
you can move into the palace.

36
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:17,980
Then we can see each other often.

37
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:29,780
Someone!

38
00:05:38,740 --> 00:05:39,100
Your Majesty.

39
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:43,700
Why is there ceremonial

40
00:05:44,740 --> 00:05:45,140
music?

41
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:49,300
Your Majesty.

42
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:51,580
It's the coronation music.

43
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,020
Coronation?

44
00:05:56,900 --> 00:05:58,220
The Crown Prince has taken the throne?

45
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:01,580
I never issued such a decree.

46
00:06:02,820 --> 00:06:04,420
Didn't you order me

47
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:06,500
to deliver the decree for approval?

48
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:08,220
And now,

49
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:10,220
Prince of Jin has ascended the throne.

50
00:06:12,020 --> 00:06:12,900
Prince of Jin?

51
00:06:14,980 --> 00:06:16,340
Why him?

52
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:21,900
You...

53
00:06:22,340 --> 00:06:22,780
You...

54
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:24,380
It was you!

55
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:26,980
You...

56
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:28,500
It was you!

57
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:29,500
You...

58
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:34,300
How dare you!

59
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:36,780
Your Majesty, you're confused.

60
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:40,940
The decree

61
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:44,020
clearly named Prince of Jin.

62
00:06:45,860 --> 00:06:46,340
Your Majesty.

63
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:47,060
Guards!

64
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:49,380
- Please look after your health.
- Chancellor Liu...

65
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:50,660
Where is Chancellor Liu?

66
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:51,780
Wanyao!

67
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:52,220
Your Majesty,

68
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:53,980
it's time for your calming tonic.

69
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,140
I won't drink it!

70
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:56,980
I won't! Guards!

71
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:57,700
Guards!

72
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:58,620
No! I won't drink it!

73
00:07:30,660 --> 00:07:31,220
Thanks.

74
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:37,100
What's going on?

75
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:38,620
Why all the secrecy?

76
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:39,700
Listen to me.

77
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:41,580
I just came from the east.

78
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:42,740
Take my advice.

79
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:45,100
Don't head east. It's dangerous.

80
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:46,740
The Shence Army went east.

81
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:48,220
War's coming.

82
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:49,580
Impossible.

83
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:50,860
If that were true,

84
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,220
we're so close to Tongguan.

85
00:07:52,780 --> 00:07:54,300
How could we have heard nothing?

86
00:07:54,860 --> 00:07:56,940
Well, maybe there's nothing they can do.

87
00:07:58,780 --> 00:07:59,300
True enough.

88
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:01,780
They say our new emperor

89
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:03,260
isn't very bright.

90
00:08:04,020 --> 00:08:04,860
You can say that again.

91
00:08:04,860 --> 00:08:05,660
Come on, let's eat.

92
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:06,060
Dig in.

93
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:07,140
Excuse me, gentlemen.

94
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:09,660
When did we get a new emperor?

95
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:12,540
You're a woman.

96
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:14,060
It's only natural you wouldn't know

97
00:08:14,060 --> 00:08:14,980
about affairs of state.

98
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:16,780
Then please tell me,

99
00:08:17,620 --> 00:08:18,900
which prince took the throne?

100
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,340
Of course I know that.

101
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:21,340
It's...

102
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:23,220
the Prince of Jin.

103
00:08:24,300 --> 00:08:25,580
Come on, let's get back to our food.

104
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:26,300
Eat up.

105
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:38,260
(Jifang Pavilion)

106
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:50,660
Why did you stop?

107
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:52,260
Keep fighting!

108
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:55,140
(Xun)

109
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:02,100
March straight on Tongguan!

110
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:04,580
Your Majesty,

111
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:06,340
here are the latest military reports,

112
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,580
and memorials from the prefectures.

113
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:09,300
Put them down.

114
00:09:10,620 --> 00:09:11,140
No, no.

115
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:12,140
Not here.

116
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:13,700
Take them to the imperial study.

117
00:09:21,740 --> 00:09:22,700
This is where we are.

118
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,340
This is Tongguan.

119
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:26,220
And this is Sheng'an.

120
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:31,460
If Prince of Jin has become emperor,

121
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:33,380
he won't be able to stop the rebels.

122
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:36,580
But why him?

123
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:38,620
And why so suddenly?

124
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:40,180
No one even sent word to me.

125
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:42,900
What is Chancellor Liu doing?

126
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:48,660
When we get back to Sheng'an,

127
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:50,220
we'll find out the truth.

128
00:09:55,860 --> 00:09:56,820
Who would have thought

129
00:09:57,500 --> 00:09:58,380
a princess's hands

130
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:00,060
could grow so calloused?

131
00:10:03,220 --> 00:10:05,340
Those are from reviewing memorials.

132
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:08,620
These are from practicing swordplay.

133
00:10:19,420 --> 00:10:20,340
Keep up!

134
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:25,140
Don't stop! Keep moving!

135
00:10:25,660 --> 00:10:26,420
Over here! This way!

136
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:27,500
Quick! Be careful!

137
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:28,460
Watch yourselves!

138
00:10:28,460 --> 00:10:28,980
Let's take a look.

139
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:33,700
Mother, I'm scared!

140
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:36,460
Hurry! Hurry!

141
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:38,860
Sir, where are you going?

142
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:40,820
Come on!

143
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:43,060
Sir!

144
00:10:44,180 --> 00:10:45,220
What's happened?

145
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:47,700
Young lady, you again?

146
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,100
Go home, quickly!

147
00:10:49,540 --> 00:10:50,140
Behind us,

148
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:52,180
many soldiers have fought their way
over there!

149
00:10:52,700 --> 00:10:54,180
I heard Tongguan has fallen!

150
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,380
I can't stay and talk!

151
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:13,340
Your Highness,

152
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:14,940
Sheng'an needs you.

153
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:20,140
There's no time.

154
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:22,020
Tongguan has fallen.

155
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:23,260
Sheng'an is in chaos.

156
00:11:24,860 --> 00:11:27,020
The rebels have seized the key pass.

157
00:11:28,180 --> 00:11:29,220
Sheng'an's current defenses

158
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:30,620
can't hold them off.

159
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:34,700
Yan Shang,

160
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:38,220
I can't return to Sheng'an with you.

161
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:15,180
♪I ride through endless sands
without rest♪

162
00:12:16,180 --> 00:12:22,580
♪Frost stains my sleeves;
The setting sun lights towers♪

163
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:28,020
♪Wild geese fly south
through late autumn♪

164
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:33,660
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

165
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:36,540
(Yan Shang.)

166
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:38,420
(Who knows if we'll)

167
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:40,980
(live to meet again)

168
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:43,500
(in this lifetime after this parting.)

169
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:45,900
(I'll wait for you in Sheng'an)

170
00:12:48,300 --> 00:12:49,100
(to come home.)

171
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:54,220
♪Whose eyes have seen
the smoke of war?♪

172
00:12:54,260 --> 00:12:57,500
♪I'll ride into battle♪

173
00:12:57,580 --> 00:13:01,580
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

174
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:06,380
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

175
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:11,440
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
May the moon shine on us forever♪

176
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:16,660
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
May the moon shine on us forever♪

177
00:13:19,300 --> 00:13:19,780
Yan Shang,

178
00:13:21,100 --> 00:13:21,740
this time,

179
00:13:23,020 --> 00:13:24,340
let me tell you a story.

180
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:25,100
All right.

181
00:13:25,540 --> 00:13:25,940
I'm listening.

182
00:13:26,860 --> 00:13:29,860
Once there was wood and iron.

183
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:32,700
The wood was made into a boat.

184
00:13:33,540 --> 00:13:35,900
Men carried the iron aboard the boat.

185
00:13:37,140 --> 00:13:38,420
They had nothing in common,

186
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:39,940
(Relay Station)
yet they felt like old friends at once.

187
00:13:40,020 --> 00:13:40,300
Sir!

188
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:41,740
Both were

189
00:13:42,580 --> 00:13:43,260
filled with joy.

190
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:43,740
Bring a new horse.

191
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:46,500
♪So many clever schemes
with a fan's wave♪

192
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:47,700
When the boat unloaded at the shore,

193
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:49,260
they parted ways.

194
00:13:50,900 --> 00:13:51,460
Later,

195
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:54,100
the iron was forged into a spear,

196
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:56,020
which broke on the battlefield.

197
00:13:56,900 --> 00:13:58,220
The wooden boat met a storm

198
00:13:59,220 --> 00:14:00,380
and shattered against the rocks.

199
00:14:02,540 --> 00:14:04,780
The broken spear became a hairpin.

200
00:14:06,300 --> 00:14:07,300
And the wrecked boat's wood

201
00:14:08,260 --> 00:14:09,700
was carved into a comb.

202
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:11,420
(Relay Station)
Here's the horse.

203
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:14,340
They met again in a beauty's hair.

204
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:15,340
All right. Thank you.

205
00:14:15,460 --> 00:14:16,500
And they were amazed to find

206
00:14:17,460 --> 00:14:19,020
how much they had both changed.

207
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:22,660
Before long,

208
00:14:23,860 --> 00:14:24,820
the beauty grew old,

209
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:26,980
and her household fell into decline.

210
00:14:26,980 --> 00:14:28,580
♪I'll ride into battle♪

211
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:29,980
They were separated again.

212
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:32,660
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

213
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:34,100
Later still,

214
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:36,540
they grew smaller and smaller,

215
00:14:37,620 --> 00:14:38,580
smaller than a finger.

216
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:42,260
The hairpin became a key,

217
00:14:43,420 --> 00:14:44,940
and the wood a little door peg.

218
00:14:47,020 --> 00:14:48,420
As the key turned in a lock,

219
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:50,740
it heard the wooden door peg

220
00:14:51,420 --> 00:14:52,500
creak a greeting,

221
00:14:53,300 --> 00:14:54,260
as if saying hello.

222
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:57,100
The key was delighted.

223
00:14:57,540 --> 00:15:00,420
♪The battle rages, the road goes on♪

224
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:01,260
But one day,

225
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:02,700
the house caught fire.

226
00:15:03,460 --> 00:15:04,380
The flames reached the doorway.

227
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:05,820
Soon,

228
00:15:06,820 --> 00:15:08,620
it swallowed the key and wooden peg.

229
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:10,780
Then?

230
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:21,340
As for the ending...

231
00:15:23,540 --> 00:15:24,860
I'll tell you

232
00:15:26,580 --> 00:15:27,540
when we meet again.

233
00:15:30,140 --> 00:15:30,540
All right.

234
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:34,060
I'll wait for you.

235
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:48,780
That traitor Mu Xun!

236
00:15:49,460 --> 00:15:51,580
How has he already crossed Tongguan?

237
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:56,180
No! My head hurts!

238
00:15:56,380 --> 00:15:57,820
I can't read any more!

239
00:15:57,820 --> 00:15:58,180
Your Majesty,

240
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:00,420
the officials await your orders.

241
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:02,220
Why haven't you reviewed

242
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:03,940
the memorials from two days ago?

243
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:07,020
Good timing. You're here.

244
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:08,100
I have a question for you!

245
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:11,140
Since becoming the Emperor,

246
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,900
I've never enjoyed
a single day of my life!

247
00:16:13,300 --> 00:16:14,300
All I have are these messes!

248
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:15,820
You've set me up!

249
00:16:19,260 --> 00:16:20,460
If you don't want to be the Emperor,

250
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:22,380
would you rather tuck your tail

251
00:16:22,660 --> 00:16:23,620
and hide in your mansion

252
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:25,300
like you used to?

253
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:29,660
Had I known,

254
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:32,420
I might as well have let Mu Wanyao

255
00:16:32,420 --> 00:16:33,740
deal with all these messes.

256
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:39,420
I propose

257
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:42,820
(Use smoke bombs against the enemy)
this deployment near the capital.

258
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:48,660
If Your Majesty has no objections,

259
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:50,060
please approve my proposal.

260
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:53,500
Approved! Approved!

261
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:54,580
(Respectfully submitted by Liu Wenji)

262
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:55,740
Approved! Approved!

263
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:04,300
(Imperial Seal)

264
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:16,340
Attendant Liu!

265
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:17,980
Attendant Liu, wait!

266
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:21,780
Attendant.

267
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:24,700
His Majesty said...

268
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:29,820
His Majesty said to leave all this
to you.

269
00:17:31,220 --> 00:17:31,620
Oh, and

270
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:33,380
there's this too.

271
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:50,940
(Tongguan has fewer than 3,000 guards)

272
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:55,100
(Your report grieves me; war is near)

273
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:07,980
(I sent an urgent dispatch to Guo)

274
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:20,180
(Here's the evidence.)

275
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:21,100
(What's all the shouting about?)

276
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:27,780
(Xin'an Relay taken; 600-li alert
Mianchi and Tongguan have fallen)

277
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:43,660
(There will still be news.)

278
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:47,580
(There will still be good news.)

279
00:20:50,660 --> 00:20:51,820
(Mu Wanyao hasn't been captured.)

280
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:54,460
(So she's safe for now.)

281
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:57,500
(That's good news, at least.)

282
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:00,260
(Chunhua would be happy)

283
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:03,140
(to hear it.)

284
00:21:06,020 --> 00:21:06,420
Excuse me.

285
00:21:07,460 --> 00:21:08,580
Where can I buy butter cakes?

286
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:10,220
Over there.

287
00:21:44,420 --> 00:21:47,660
(Zuiyue Tower)

288
00:22:01,220 --> 00:22:01,620
Shang!

289
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:08,580
Shang!

290
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:14,900
Your eyes have healed?

291
00:22:24,140 --> 00:22:24,780
Wenji.

292
00:22:25,700 --> 00:22:27,220
All 117 letters,

293
00:22:28,380 --> 00:22:29,500
I received every one.

294
00:22:31,620 --> 00:22:32,180
You needn't say anything.

295
00:22:32,980 --> 00:22:33,580
I know.

296
00:22:34,300 --> 00:22:35,060
When did you get back?

297
00:22:35,380 --> 00:22:36,300
Why didn't you tell me?

298
00:22:36,900 --> 00:22:38,060
I could have welcomed you properly!

299
00:22:45,020 --> 00:22:45,540
Wenji,

300
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:50,740
Prince of Jin

301
00:22:52,060 --> 00:22:52,580
has taken the throne?

302
00:23:04,700 --> 00:23:05,020
Shang,

303
00:23:06,060 --> 00:23:06,580
this isn't

304
00:23:07,060 --> 00:23:07,820
the place to talk.

305
00:23:08,500 --> 00:23:09,220
Come back to the palace with me.

306
00:23:09,540 --> 00:23:09,860
Come on.

307
00:23:12,780 --> 00:23:16,660
(Liangyi Hall)

308
00:23:39,020 --> 00:23:39,460
Shang.

309
00:23:53,740 --> 00:23:57,580
(Universe in Harmony)

310
00:23:57,580 --> 00:23:58,780
It can't have been easy to return

311
00:23:59,180 --> 00:23:59,740
to the capital now.

312
00:24:04,420 --> 00:24:06,060
(Universe in Harmony)

313
00:24:06,060 --> 00:24:06,620
Was the journey dangerous?

314
00:24:07,220 --> 00:24:07,700
Fortunately,

315
00:24:08,300 --> 00:24:09,060
we made it back safely.

316
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:12,020
(Universe in Harmony)

317
00:24:12,020 --> 00:24:13,420
The rebels are nearing Sheng'an.

318
00:24:14,140 --> 00:24:15,060
Where is the deposed Crown Prince?

319
00:24:17,460 --> 00:24:17,820
He's escaped.

320
00:24:19,420 --> 00:24:20,860
No wonder the rebels are so brazen.

321
00:24:21,460 --> 00:24:22,940
Mu Xun must be leading them himself.

322
00:24:23,540 --> 00:24:24,260
What is Prince of Jin...

323
00:24:25,620 --> 00:24:26,900
the Emperor, planning to do?

324
00:24:28,060 --> 00:24:28,540
Wenji,

325
00:24:29,260 --> 00:24:30,060
you must know that.

326
00:24:32,620 --> 00:24:34,140
The deposed Crown Prince is a traitor.

327
00:24:34,380 --> 00:24:35,860
If he dares attack Sheng'an,

328
00:24:36,580 --> 00:24:37,500
then he must be executed

329
00:24:38,100 --> 00:24:39,060
to uphold the law of the realm.

330
00:24:39,540 --> 00:24:40,180
Exactly.

331
00:24:40,980 --> 00:24:43,020
Locusts and drought ravage the land.

332
00:24:43,540 --> 00:24:44,500
If war breaks out again,

333
00:24:44,860 --> 00:24:45,820
countless innocent lives will be lost.

334
00:24:46,900 --> 00:24:48,100
Yet all along my journey,

335
00:24:49,420 --> 00:24:52,140
I saw no troop preparations in Sheng'an.

336
00:24:53,060 --> 00:24:53,660
Why is that?

337
00:25:09,820 --> 00:25:10,380
Wenji.

338
00:25:12,820 --> 00:25:13,580
Troop deployments

339
00:25:14,020 --> 00:25:14,700
are classified military affairs.

340
00:25:15,540 --> 00:25:16,460
They're no concern of yours.

341
00:25:17,820 --> 00:25:19,140
The danger is upon us.

342
00:25:19,940 --> 00:25:21,740
How many Shence troops
can still be mobilized?

343
00:25:25,340 --> 00:25:27,180
I'm in command of the army now.

344
00:25:28,060 --> 00:25:29,340
Do you know more about war than I do?

345
00:25:48,460 --> 00:25:48,780
Shang.

346
00:25:50,780 --> 00:25:51,340
I heard

347
00:25:52,420 --> 00:25:53,500
Grand Princess Danyang

348
00:25:54,260 --> 00:25:55,540
went to Lanyang for disaster relief.

349
00:26:00,020 --> 00:26:01,260
You must have seen her already.

350
00:26:07,820 --> 00:26:08,220
Yes.

351
00:26:09,420 --> 00:26:10,380
You returned together, didn't you?

352
00:26:13,860 --> 00:26:14,860
Why are you here alone?

353
00:26:18,460 --> 00:26:19,220
Where is the Grand Princess?

354
00:26:24,060 --> 00:26:25,180
When she left the capital,

355
00:26:26,940 --> 00:26:28,980
she was the Guardian of the Realm.

356
00:26:29,780 --> 00:26:30,300
But now,

357
00:26:30,820 --> 00:26:31,700
with a new emperor on the throne,

358
00:26:32,300 --> 00:26:34,020
she's neither regent nor acting ruler.

359
00:26:34,340 --> 00:26:35,460
Her status is unclear.

360
00:26:36,580 --> 00:26:37,300
If she returns,

361
00:26:38,100 --> 00:26:39,180
what title should she bear?

362
00:26:39,940 --> 00:26:40,500
And how

363
00:26:41,180 --> 00:26:42,060
should she be received?

364
00:26:45,020 --> 00:26:46,140
So she's afraid to return.

365
00:26:47,460 --> 00:26:48,260
Then tell me

366
00:26:48,780 --> 00:26:49,460
where she is.

367
00:26:53,220 --> 00:26:53,540
Shang,

368
00:26:55,060 --> 00:26:56,260
I can keep you safe.

369
00:26:57,580 --> 00:26:58,940
And before the Emperor,

370
00:26:59,820 --> 00:27:01,300
I can protect the Princess's rank.

371
00:27:09,580 --> 00:27:10,380
I'm afraid

372
00:27:10,980 --> 00:27:11,900
I can't tell you.

373
00:27:19,620 --> 00:27:19,980
Shang,

374
00:27:21,580 --> 00:27:23,060
with things so dangerous,

375
00:27:24,260 --> 00:27:26,060
why come back and risk your lives?

376
00:27:33,540 --> 00:27:35,380
When the nest falls, no egg survives.

377
00:27:36,140 --> 00:27:37,220
Facing a national crisis together

378
00:27:38,100 --> 00:27:39,220
isn't taking a foolish risk.

379
00:27:44,500 --> 00:27:45,100
Shang,

380
00:27:46,820 --> 00:27:48,940
you really can't adapt, can you?

381
00:27:52,260 --> 00:27:53,060
As for me,

382
00:27:54,500 --> 00:27:55,300
I had no choice.

383
00:27:56,420 --> 00:27:57,020
If I were you,

384
00:27:58,140 --> 00:27:59,580
I'd go into seclusion with my beloved,

385
00:27:59,820 --> 00:28:01,060
far away from danger.

386
00:28:01,500 --> 00:28:02,540
Couldn't you be happy

387
00:28:02,540 --> 00:28:03,580
to live together in peace?

388
00:28:04,180 --> 00:28:05,300
She would never choose that.

389
00:28:06,980 --> 00:28:07,540
As it happens,

390
00:28:08,860 --> 00:28:09,380
neither would I.

391
00:28:12,740 --> 00:28:14,180
Then you're both too greedy.

392
00:28:19,540 --> 00:28:20,260
Wenji,

393
00:28:22,180 --> 00:28:23,100
I once believed

394
00:28:24,780 --> 00:28:25,940
you would always be yourself.

395
00:28:28,020 --> 00:28:28,820
And I still am.

396
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:31,340
Yes.

397
00:28:33,860 --> 00:28:35,100
You're still Liu Wenji.

398
00:28:37,420 --> 00:28:38,220
But

399
00:28:40,060 --> 00:28:43,300
you're no longer the dear friend

400
00:28:44,740 --> 00:28:45,780
I knew in Lingnan.

401
00:29:00,420 --> 00:29:00,900
Shang,

402
00:29:02,540 --> 00:29:03,940
it's too late to regret it.

403
00:29:05,300 --> 00:29:06,700
You were wrong all along.

404
00:29:08,300 --> 00:29:10,340
From the day you saved my life,

405
00:29:10,860 --> 00:29:12,380
you've been terribly wrong!

406
00:29:13,420 --> 00:29:14,140
That year,

407
00:29:15,220 --> 00:29:16,780
I lost Chunhua forever.

408
00:29:18,580 --> 00:29:20,020
And I lost my own manhood forever.

409
00:29:25,620 --> 00:29:26,900
Who rescued me?

410
00:29:29,580 --> 00:29:30,740
Who avenged me,

411
00:29:35,700 --> 00:29:36,700
gave me hope,

412
00:29:37,420 --> 00:29:40,140
and left me to live in this broken body?

413
00:29:44,740 --> 00:29:45,940
How could I

414
00:29:47,860 --> 00:29:49,460
ever accept

415
00:29:49,740 --> 00:29:52,020
being a lowly eunuch slave forever?

416
00:29:52,500 --> 00:29:53,540
After you saved me,

417
00:29:53,700 --> 00:29:55,340
this is my only way forward!

418
00:30:03,500 --> 00:30:05,140
Do you want to be
the next Yu Cheng'an?

419
00:30:06,580 --> 00:30:08,420
Don't you know how he ended up?

420
00:30:08,620 --> 00:30:09,500
You're cursing me?

421
00:30:10,620 --> 00:30:11,180
Yan Shang,

422
00:30:11,660 --> 00:30:13,100
I never thought the day would come

423
00:30:13,100 --> 00:30:14,620
when I'd hear you curse me!

424
00:30:24,300 --> 00:30:24,860
In the end,

425
00:30:26,940 --> 00:30:28,460
you've always looked down on me.

426
00:30:29,700 --> 00:30:30,380
Tell me

427
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:32,220
where Mu Wanyao is.

428
00:30:33,820 --> 00:30:34,820
Our friendship as classmates

429
00:30:35,820 --> 00:30:37,020
might still be saved.

430
00:30:43,820 --> 00:30:44,900
If our positions were reversed,

431
00:30:46,500 --> 00:30:47,260
I'm sure you

432
00:30:48,500 --> 00:30:50,140
would never surrender Chunhua either.

433
00:30:50,660 --> 00:30:50,940
You...

434
00:30:55,140 --> 00:30:55,860
And neither will I.

435
00:30:59,620 --> 00:31:00,740
Urgent report!

436
00:31:02,660 --> 00:31:04,180
Urgent report from the army!

437
00:31:12,500 --> 00:31:13,020
Yan Shang,

438
00:31:14,580 --> 00:31:16,060
stay right here!

439
00:31:21,660 --> 00:31:22,900
The rebels moved west along the Su River

440
00:31:23,180 --> 00:31:24,100
and raided Pujinguan overnight.

441
00:31:24,340 --> 00:31:25,260
They've passed Tongzhou

442
00:31:25,500 --> 00:31:26,740
and are heading for northern Sheng'an!

443
00:31:27,380 --> 00:31:28,060
How could this happen?

444
00:31:28,620 --> 00:31:29,540
What's going on?

445
00:31:29,660 --> 00:31:30,220
What are we going to do?

446
00:31:30,220 --> 00:31:31,460
How did they get here so fast?

447
00:31:31,780 --> 00:31:32,460
Exactly!

448
00:31:32,460 --> 00:31:33,700
Can we even stop them?

449
00:31:35,900 --> 00:31:36,340
Attendant Liu,

450
00:31:37,980 --> 00:31:39,660
this isn't what you predicted!

451
00:31:47,820 --> 00:31:48,380
How far away are they?

452
00:31:48,780 --> 00:31:49,380
Attendant Liu,

453
00:31:49,780 --> 00:31:51,900
they're less than 100 li from the gates!

454
00:31:52,700 --> 00:31:53,020
What?

455
00:31:53,020 --> 00:31:54,300
Seriously?

456
00:31:54,300 --> 00:31:55,340
They're less than 100 li away!

457
00:31:55,340 --> 00:31:56,020
This... This...

458
00:32:16,140 --> 00:32:17,220
Chancellor Liu. It's been a while.

459
00:32:17,740 --> 00:32:21,060
The deposed Crown Prince's troops
have crossed Tongguan, right?

460
00:32:28,260 --> 00:32:29,900
Your foresight is remarkable.

461
00:32:30,660 --> 00:32:33,300
Not enough to foresee a petty plot.

462
00:32:33,900 --> 00:32:36,540
Giving the throne
to the deposed Crown Prince

463
00:32:37,180 --> 00:32:38,580
would have been a poor choice,

464
00:32:39,380 --> 00:32:40,740
let alone Prince of Jin.

465
00:32:42,100 --> 00:32:43,700
The Retired Emperor is barely lucid.

466
00:32:44,620 --> 00:32:45,780
Could he really have decided this?

467
00:32:50,300 --> 00:32:51,180
Liu Wenji,

468
00:32:52,100 --> 00:32:54,940
you forged a decree and seized power.

469
00:32:55,300 --> 00:32:57,020
You put that fool on the throne.

470
00:32:58,540 --> 00:33:00,540
Without
the deposed Crown Prince's revolt,

471
00:33:01,060 --> 00:33:03,740
you'd be cut in half in the marketplace.

472
00:33:12,260 --> 00:33:14,860
Then Heaven must want me alive.

473
00:33:20,580 --> 00:33:21,300
Yes.

474
00:33:22,740 --> 00:33:23,860
You're right.

475
00:33:24,420 --> 00:33:26,140
We put down the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

476
00:33:27,580 --> 00:33:29,900
but that wasn't the end of our troubles.

477
00:33:30,700 --> 00:33:33,140
It began the eunuchs' ruinous rule!

478
00:33:34,620 --> 00:33:38,620
Eunuchs and military governors

479
00:33:38,980 --> 00:33:41,220
have left the whole realm in ruins.

480
00:33:43,860 --> 00:33:45,140
Only these last three years

481
00:33:45,620 --> 00:33:46,380
have the people

482
00:33:47,100 --> 00:33:49,300
had a little peace,

483
00:33:50,220 --> 00:33:52,260
and Huai has begun to recover.

484
00:33:52,860 --> 00:33:53,580
What a pity.

485
00:33:54,540 --> 00:33:56,580
It lasted just three short years.

486
00:33:59,300 --> 00:34:00,180
Speak your mind, Chancellor Liu.

487
00:34:00,900 --> 00:34:03,020
Tell the court in the hall.

488
00:34:03,540 --> 00:34:04,540
The rebels are nearing Sheng'an.

489
00:34:04,940 --> 00:34:06,060
I came today

490
00:34:06,380 --> 00:34:09,980
to ask you to save Huai.

491
00:34:23,580 --> 00:34:24,500
Liu Wenji.

492
00:34:25,420 --> 00:34:29,420
History will judge you harshly,
and the people will curse you.

493
00:34:32,660 --> 00:34:33,900
Don't forget

494
00:34:34,580 --> 00:34:36,900
what happened to Yu Cheng'an!

495
00:34:44,980 --> 00:34:46,340
The rebels really are coming!

496
00:34:46,780 --> 00:34:47,620
So quickly?

497
00:34:52,420 --> 00:34:54,380
Everyone, you serve in high office!

498
00:34:55,100 --> 00:34:57,300
Why are you panicking like this?

499
00:35:09,660 --> 00:35:11,740
Runner-up
in the first year of Yingxiang.

500
00:35:15,900 --> 00:35:18,260
A Presented Scholar
in the fourth year of Chunhe.

501
00:35:19,860 --> 00:35:22,060
A Presented Scholar
in the 12th year of Yingxiang.

502
00:35:24,580 --> 00:35:28,380
Top scholar in the 11th year of Chunhe.

503
00:35:32,700 --> 00:35:34,060
Everyone, back then,

504
00:35:34,540 --> 00:35:36,660
when you took the imperial exams,

505
00:35:37,420 --> 00:35:40,940
you all swore loyalty to the realm.

506
00:35:43,180 --> 00:35:44,300
Throughout Sheng'an,

507
00:35:45,060 --> 00:35:46,260
the noble families

508
00:35:46,820 --> 00:35:48,700
live off the people's hard labor.

509
00:35:49,660 --> 00:35:52,380
If we are all at a loss

510
00:35:52,900 --> 00:35:54,060
and fall into chaos,

511
00:35:54,460 --> 00:35:57,020
we'll destroy the troops' morale.

512
00:35:57,700 --> 00:35:59,540
How can we expect the army

513
00:35:59,780 --> 00:36:02,060
to fight to the death for the city?

514
00:36:10,380 --> 00:36:11,900
Who would stay behind to die?

515
00:36:12,460 --> 00:36:12,860
Well?

516
00:36:14,020 --> 00:36:14,820
I've always said

517
00:36:15,540 --> 00:36:16,660
Chancellor Liu holds us together.

518
00:36:17,100 --> 00:36:17,780
He must not be killed recklessly.

519
00:36:20,980 --> 00:36:22,860
Attendant Liu had great foresight.

520
00:36:29,740 --> 00:36:30,580
The military situation is dire.

521
00:36:31,140 --> 00:36:32,100
Chancellor Liu, do you have a plan

522
00:36:32,580 --> 00:36:33,260
to save the realm?

523
00:36:46,540 --> 00:36:47,740
Sheng'an now

524
00:36:48,340 --> 00:36:49,500
hangs by a thread.

525
00:36:50,900 --> 00:36:52,380
During the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

526
00:36:53,140 --> 00:36:54,020
the Retired Emperor

527
00:36:54,740 --> 00:36:56,380
withdrew to the Shu region.

528
00:36:57,340 --> 00:36:59,620
The danger is greater now.

529
00:37:00,380 --> 00:37:01,500
I urge Your Majesty

530
00:37:01,980 --> 00:37:05,220
and the Retired Emperor
to go south at once

531
00:37:05,500 --> 00:37:06,580
with the assembled ministers

532
00:37:07,580 --> 00:37:08,420
and take refuge temporarily

533
00:37:09,340 --> 00:37:10,140
in Jinzhou.

534
00:37:10,700 --> 00:37:11,740
Abandon Sheng'an?

535
00:37:14,660 --> 00:37:15,500
Then what happens to Sheng'an?

536
00:37:17,620 --> 00:37:18,780
Defend it to the death!

537
00:37:18,980 --> 00:37:19,780
To the death?

538
00:37:20,260 --> 00:37:21,020
Who can hold it?

539
00:37:23,180 --> 00:37:25,140
How can we defend it as things stand?

540
00:37:25,140 --> 00:37:26,140
Exactly!

541
00:37:26,900 --> 00:37:28,140
What can we defend it with?

542
00:37:46,220 --> 00:37:46,700
I,

543
00:37:47,460 --> 00:37:48,940
Yan Shang, Magistrate of Lanyang,

544
00:37:50,340 --> 00:37:52,180
volunteer to defend Sheng'an.

545
00:38:18,780 --> 00:38:19,940
(Temporary Imperial Palace; Huai)
The army is outside Sheng'an.

546
00:38:20,340 --> 00:38:20,820
We mustn't rush in.

547
00:38:22,020 --> 00:38:23,500
Let's first camp
at the temporary imperial palace.

548
00:38:30,620 --> 00:38:31,460
Grand Princess,

549
00:38:32,700 --> 00:38:33,660
it's been a long time.

550
00:38:40,940 --> 00:38:43,180
(Huai)

551
00:38:50,020 --> 00:38:50,660
(Huai)
Mu Xun!

552
00:38:51,940 --> 00:38:52,740
What are you doing?

553
00:38:54,580 --> 00:38:55,380
I'll be taking over

554
00:38:56,380 --> 00:38:57,460
this place for a few days.

555
00:38:57,980 --> 00:38:58,620
Taking over?

556
00:39:00,100 --> 00:39:00,980
What for?

557
00:39:02,140 --> 00:39:03,420
To attack Sheng'an?

558
00:39:04,260 --> 00:39:05,340
Within an hour,

559
00:39:06,300 --> 00:39:07,500
my men will clear this place.

560
00:39:08,380 --> 00:39:09,340
Stay or leave.

561
00:39:10,100 --> 00:39:11,100
The choice is yours.

562
00:39:12,060 --> 00:39:13,620
Open your eyes and take a good look!

563
00:39:15,100 --> 00:39:16,780
I am staying here!

564
00:39:17,780 --> 00:39:19,020
You insolent traitor!

565
00:39:19,860 --> 00:39:21,940
How dare you bark at my door!

566
00:39:22,700 --> 00:39:23,460
So,

567
00:39:24,980 --> 00:39:26,060
you won't give it up?

568
00:39:31,140 --> 00:39:32,260
When our founding emperors

569
00:39:33,260 --> 00:39:34,460
made Sheng'an their capital,

570
00:39:35,500 --> 00:39:36,620
they surely never imagined

571
00:39:38,540 --> 00:39:40,060
that their own descendants

572
00:39:41,460 --> 00:39:42,580
would march an army on Sheng'an,

573
00:39:43,980 --> 00:39:45,780
(Huai)
plunge the realm into war,

574
00:39:46,900 --> 00:39:48,580
and endanger our ancestral temples.

575
00:39:49,620 --> 00:39:51,900
You disgrace your ancestors!

576
00:39:54,580 --> 00:39:56,860
You're unworthy of the Mu bloodline!

577
00:39:58,940 --> 00:40:00,700
You dare speak of our ancestors?

578
00:40:04,140 --> 00:40:05,660
(Huai)
Prepare to fight!

579
00:40:15,140 --> 00:40:15,580
Kill!

580
00:40:15,740 --> 00:40:17,460
Kill!

581
00:41:00,740 --> 00:41:01,540
What about now?

582
00:41:02,700 --> 00:41:03,660
Will you give it up?

583
00:41:03,860 --> 00:41:07,340
(Huai)

584
00:41:12,940 --> 00:41:13,940
No!

585
00:41:16,620 --> 00:41:19,060
(Huai)

586
00:41:48,940 --> 00:41:49,620
Yan Shang,

587
00:41:50,900 --> 00:41:52,660
you're losing ground.

588
00:41:53,140 --> 00:41:54,340
Your moves today, Master,

589
00:41:54,980 --> 00:41:55,860
are as fierce as thunder,

590
00:41:56,980 --> 00:41:58,180
unlike your usual playing style.

591
00:42:09,220 --> 00:42:12,180
How does it feel to be cornered?

592
00:42:13,380 --> 00:42:14,140
Black still

593
00:42:15,540 --> 00:42:16,620
has a chance to survive.

594
00:42:17,980 --> 00:42:19,180
I may not lose, Master.

595
00:42:28,060 --> 00:42:28,500
Master...

596
00:42:36,700 --> 00:42:37,220
That's enough.

597
00:42:38,740 --> 00:42:40,180
Let's end today's game

598
00:42:41,060 --> 00:42:42,100
right here.

599
00:42:49,300 --> 00:42:51,020
You're teaching me to defend a city?

600
00:42:59,540 --> 00:43:00,540
We haven't even reached the middle game.

601
00:43:01,340 --> 00:43:03,060
Why won't you finish it with me?

602
00:43:04,060 --> 00:43:05,580
There's still much I don't understand.

603
00:43:06,300 --> 00:43:07,220
I need your guidance.

604
00:43:07,820 --> 00:43:09,260
There's no time.

605
00:43:10,620 --> 00:43:13,140
His Majesty leaves the capital today.

606
00:43:14,940 --> 00:43:16,860
I'll personally escort them out.

607
00:43:24,980 --> 00:43:26,380
An isolated group

608
00:43:27,260 --> 00:43:29,060
isn't necessarily doomed.

609
00:43:30,500 --> 00:43:31,700
There's still room on the board.

610
00:43:32,260 --> 00:43:33,420
Find another way to survive,

611
00:43:34,140 --> 00:43:34,980
wait for an opening,

612
00:43:36,340 --> 00:43:37,580
and strike back.

613
00:43:38,060 --> 00:43:38,780
I understand, Master.

614
00:43:47,980 --> 00:43:49,860
The ladder has already formed.

615
00:43:50,460 --> 00:43:52,740
It presses closer with every move.

616
00:43:54,460 --> 00:43:55,940
Without supporting stones,

617
00:43:58,500 --> 00:43:59,820
I'm afraid the whole group

618
00:44:00,540 --> 00:44:02,140
will be captured.

619
00:44:02,860 --> 00:44:03,660
I believe

620
00:44:05,100 --> 00:44:05,740
help will come.

621
00:44:22,620 --> 00:44:27,340
(Next Episode Preview)

622
00:44:27,380 --> 00:44:28,300
They're killing innocent civilians

623
00:44:28,660 --> 00:44:29,820
just to force us to open the gates!

624
00:44:29,980 --> 00:44:30,540
If we open them,

625
00:44:30,700 --> 00:44:32,060
they'll storm the city.

626
00:44:32,260 --> 00:44:32,820
If we don't,

627
00:44:33,060 --> 00:44:34,580
we'll lose the people's trust.

628
00:44:34,940 --> 00:44:37,260
Anyone who lays down their arms
and surrenders now

629
00:44:37,460 --> 00:44:38,460
will be pardoned

630
00:44:39,020 --> 00:44:40,300
(Guanghua Gate)
and may return home!

631
00:44:45,161 --> 00:44:48,454
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

632
00:44:51,139 --> 00:44:56,055
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

633
00:44:58,249 --> 00:45:04,094
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

634
00:45:04,594 --> 00:45:09,820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

635
00:45:12,589 --> 00:45:17,380
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

636
00:45:18,216 --> 00:45:24,295
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

637
00:45:26,096 --> 00:45:29,246
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

638
00:45:29,246 --> 00:45:30,894
♪Burning bright as a song♪

639
00:45:30,946 --> 00:45:34,670
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

640
00:45:35,048 --> 00:45:39,714
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

641
00:45:40,333 --> 00:45:44,374
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

642
00:45:44,865 --> 00:45:46,980
♪Not a single hour less♪

643
00:45:47,020 --> 00:45:53,966
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

644
00:45:54,729 --> 00:45:58,182
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

645
00:45:58,362 --> 00:46:01,507
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

646
00:46:01,946 --> 00:46:08,583
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

647
00:46:08,980 --> 00:46:11,018
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

648
00:46:11,018 --> 00:46:13,494
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

649
00:46:13,532 --> 00:46:16,001
♪You're the only one I need♪

650
00:46:16,205 --> 00:46:23,092
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

651
00:46:23,404 --> 00:46:26,675
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

652
00:46:26,980 --> 00:46:30,153
♪My last untouched innocence♪

653
00:46:30,477 --> 00:46:33,903
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

654
00:46:34,136 --> 00:46:37,361
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

655
00:46:37,692 --> 00:46:44,488
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

656
00:46:44,857 --> 00:46:46,919
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

657
00:46:46,920 --> 00:46:49,423
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

658
00:46:49,470 --> 00:46:51,808
♪You're the only one I need♪

659
00:46:52,039 --> 00:46:58,874
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

660
00:46:59,223 --> 00:47:00,841
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

661
00:47:00,971 --> 00:47:02,767
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

662
00:47:03,124 --> 00:47:06,141
♪You're the only one I need♪

663
00:47:06,181 --> 00:47:07,508
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

